flowchart TD
    MainMenu[Main Menu]
    ContentFile[Choose Content File]
    ScenarioCatalog[Choose Scenario from Manifest/Catalog]
    EditorContext[Editor Context\nContentEditorSession + selected document]
    EditorMode[Editor Mode\nAuthor templates, scenarios, action plans, inventory layouts]
    Preview[Scenario Preview\nTurn 0 materialization]
    SimulationMode[Simulation Mode\nRuntime session + entity panel chain]
    ReturnEditor[Return to previous Editor context]
    SourceJump[Source Jump\nRuntime entity/log/diagnostic -> authored template/action plan/scenario]
    DeferredDebug[Deferred Debug Capabilities\nLive hot-editing / runtime debug mutation]

    MainMenu --> ContentFile --> EditorContext --> EditorMode
    MainMenu --> ScenarioCatalog --> EditorContext
    EditorMode --> Preview
    Preview --> SimulationMode
    EditorMode --> SimulationMode
    ScenarioCatalog --> SimulationMode
    SimulationMode --> ReturnEditor --> EditorMode
    SimulationMode -. when provenance exists .-> SourceJump --> EditorMode
    SimulationMode -. future only .-> DeferredDebug

